-- title:
--   Shifting locally principal ideals by the ramified prime P
-- statement:
--   Fix $a,b\in\mathbb Q$ and a prime $q'$, and assume `IsDefiniteRamifiedExactlyAt a b q'`: $a<0$, $b<0$, and for every height-one prime $v$ of $\mathcal O_{\mathbb Q}$ the completion $\mathbb H[\mathbb Q,a,b]\otimes_{\mathbb Q}\mathbb Q_v$ has all its nonzero elements invertible exactly when $q'\in v$. Let $\Lambda$ be a $\mathbb Z$-submodule of $\mathbb H[\mathbb Q,a,b]$ which is a maximal order, i.e. $1\in\Lambda$, $\Lambda$ is closed under multiplication, finitely generated, spans $\mathbb H[\mathbb Q,a,b]$ over $\mathbb Q$, and every order containing $\Lambda$ equals $\Lambda$. Let $\pi$ be a unit of $\mathbb H[\mathbb Q,a,b]\otimes_{\mathbb Q}\mathbb A_{\mathbb Q,f}$ whose component [`Submodule.finiteAdeleEvalAt`](def/Submodule_LocalBox.html#L36) at each finite place $w$ with $q'\notin w$ equals $1$, and assume that the lattice [`Submodule.ofFiniteIdele Λ π`](def/Submodule_FiniteAdeleBox.html#L19) — the set of $h\in\mathbb H[\mathbb Q,a,b]$ whose image under `includeLeft` lies in $\pi\cdot$`finiteAdeleBox Λ`, the additive group generated by the $z\otimes\alpha$ with $z\in\Lambda$ and $\alpha$ an integral adele — consists exactly of the $h\in\Lambda$ with $h=0$ or $v_{q'}(\mathrm{nrd}\,h)\ge 1$. Then for every unit $x$ of $\mathbb H[\mathbb Q,a,b]\otimes_{\mathbb Q}\mathbb A_{\mathbb Q,f}$ one has `ofFiniteIdele Λ (x * π) = ofFiniteIdele Λ x * ofFiniteIdele Λ π` as $\mathbb Z$-submodules, and $z\in$ `ofFiniteIdele Λ (x * π * π)` holds if and only if $z=q'y$ for some $y\in$ `ofFiniteIdele Λ x`.
--
--   This is the standard behaviour of the two-sided prime $\mathfrak P$ of a maximal order in a definite quaternion algebra at its ramified place: multiplying a finite idele by a uniformiser at $q'$ multiplies the associated locally principal lattice by $\mathfrak P$, and doing it twice multiplies by $\mathfrak P^2=q'\Lambda$. It is used in the computation of the kernel ideal of a Frobenius-twisted isogeny in [`CerednikDrinfeld.image_kernelIdealSet_ratPointHom_frobenius_comp_eq_star_smul_ofFiniteIdele_mul`](thm.html#CerednikDrinfeld.image_kernelIdealSet_ratPointHom_frobenius_comp_eq_star_smul_ofFiniteIdele_mul).
